- op: discuss  # b94d
  at: '2026-11-09T01:44:11Z'  # b94d
  by: agent  # b94d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b94d
  clock: 3  # b94d
  nonce: b94d  # b94d
  message: "Fixed in PR #2094. yaml_ansible.py: a task's kind comes from the section key that holds its list (_section_of: tasks/pre_tasks/post_tasks -> task, handlers -> handler, block/rescue/always inherit from their owner); a file with no play takes its kind from a tasks/ or handlers/ path component. Live repro, same input on dev and branch: site.yml with pre_tasks, tasks, block/rescue and handlers, plus roles/web/tasks/main.yml and roles/web/handlers/main.yml. Dev: all five play entries emitted as handler, role files emit nothing. Branch: Update cache, Install nginx, Try deploy, Roll back -> task; Restart nginx -> handler; Copy config -> task; Reload web -> handler; a loop item named 'not a task' is not emitted. Tests: TestAnsibleTaskSections."  # b94d
